@*
    Asset Register -- Asset & Contract Management, Phase 4.1 (migration 428).
    Rendered from Manage.cshtml when Model.Key == "asset-register".

    BRD 5 / 5.1.14 / 5.1.16 / 5.2.1: assets are registered on the Active
    form template of their asset type; the form's sections, fields and
    conditional rules come from the template (420 / 421), pickers from
    the organization's option lists (423) and masters, and every save runs
    the same validation as the API (sp_asset_register_save). An asset keeps
    the template version it was registered with. New assets start as Draft.

    429 (BRD 19.9 / 5.4.3 / 11 / 5.3.10): the Lifecycle tab offers only the
    configured moves from the asset's status, shows each move's BRD gate
    and asks for the reason / reference / evidence it requires; moves with
    an approval gate wait for a different person with APPROVE. "Transition
    rules" shows the whole matrix (decision D16). Every gate is enforced by
    sp_asset_lifecycle_transition / sp_asset_lifecycle_decide.

    430 (BRD 4.6 / 4.7 / 4.8): the Technology tab shows the current firmware
    and OS with release status, recommended target and classification
    (Current / Due Soon / Unsupported / Exception / Unknown), records
    installations (history with previous version, result, rollback,
    licence, evidence) and manages technology exceptions (requested,
    approved by another person, withdrawn, revoked; active until expiry).

    435 (BRD 5.1.11 / 5.2.14): the Coverage tab shows the calculated
    coverage status overall and per coverage type, the coverage the asset
    type requires with any gap, and every coverage line of approved
    contract versions (maintained on the Contracts screen).

    431 (BRD 5.3): the Custody tab shows the verification status, last /
    next attestation dates, the applicable attestation profile, the
    effective-dated owner / custodian / location history and the asset's
    acknowledgements and attestations (answered on Asset Attestation).
    432: plus the asset's verification exceptions (worked on Asset Attestation
    -> Exceptions).

    433 (BRD 11): the Workflows tab starts and runs owner change, location
    transfer, breakdown and disposal cases step by step (worker steps,
    approvals, owner confirmations), each step moving the asset through the
    lifecycle matrix; "Workflow cases" in the list toolbar shows the
    organization's open cases and those waiting for the signed-in person.

    446 (BRD 5.1.18 / 5.1.18.5.7 / 5.1.18.5.8): the Valuation tab shows the
    stored Asset Value (score, category, configuration version, method,
    validation status) next to what the Active configuration gives now,
    the calculation history, Recalculate (EDIT; a reason when a newer
    configuration version applies) and Override method (APPROVE; only when
    the configuration permits it; reason required). Asset Value Score and
    Category on the form are read-only and come from the stored result.

    447 (BRD 19.7 / 5.1.18.3): the Valuation tab also lists the asset's CIA /
    criticality consistency findings -- accept with rationale, evidence,
    owner and review date (EDIT), approve / reject / revoke (APPROVE, not
    the requester), withdraw, re-evaluate -- and the risks linked to the
    asset with the Asset Value the risk module reads and a review flag.
    "Consistency findings" in the list toolbar is the organization worklist.

    448 (BRD 5.1.10 / 5.1.15 / 5.1.16 / 5.1.17 / 5.2.15 / 5.2.16): the
    Privacy tab shows the asset's privacy status, open privacy requirement
    gaps, exceptions and privacy / retention reviews (read-only). Exceptions
    and reviews are acted on in Asset Privacy ("Open in Asset Privacy").

    450: opened with ?organizationId=&assetId= (Asset Governance KPI
    drill-down) the screen opens that asset.

    Backend: practice/api/asset-config/register... (AssetConfigController)
    Script : wwwroot/js/AssetConfig/asset-register.js
*@
@model PracticeManagement.Web.Models.PracticeScreen
@{
    var argPermissions = ViewBag.Permissions as string[] ?? [];
    bool argHas(string action) => argPermissions.Any(p => p.Equals(action, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) || p == "*");
    var argCanAdd = argHas("ADD");
    var argCanEdit = argHas("EDIT");
    var argCanApprove = argHas("APPROVE");
}

<div class="pm-page-heading compact">
    <div>
        <p class="pm-eyebrow">@Model.Group / @Model.Title</p>
        <h1>@Model.Title</h1>
        <p>@Model.Description</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="argRoot" data-can-add="@(argCanAdd ? "1" : "0")" data-can-edit="@(argCanEdit ? "1" : "0")" data-can-approve="@(argCanApprove ? "1" : "0")">

    @* ============================ List ============================ *@
    <section class="pm-panel" id="argListView">
        <div class="pm-toolbar">
            <select id="argOrg" title="Organization"><option value="">Select organization</option></select>
            <input type="search" id="argSearch" placeholder="Search name or ID" maxlength="200" />
            <select id="argTypeFilter" title="Asset type"><option value="">All asset types</option></select>
            <select id="argStatusFilter" title="Status"><option value="">All statuses</option></select>
            <label class="arg-check"><input type="checkbox" id="argPendingOnly" /> Pending approval only</label>
            <button class="pm-button" id="argMatrixBtn" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project"></i> Transition rules</button>
            <button class="pm-button" id="argWfListBtn" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Workflow cases</button>
            <button class="pm-button" id="argConsListBtn" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced"></i> Consistency findings</button>
            @if (argCanAdd)
            {
                <button class="pm-button primary" id="argNewBtn" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> New Asset</button>
            }
            <button class="pm-button icon" id="argRefresh" type="button" title="Refresh" aria-label="Refresh"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i></button>
        </div>
        <div class="pm-table-wrap">
            <table>
                <thead><tr><th>Asset</th><th>Asset type</th><th>Status</th><th>Owner</th><th>Location</th><th>Criticality</th><th>Form</th><th>Last changed</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody id="argListBody"><tr><td colspan="8" class="pm-empty">Select an organization.</td></tr></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <div id="argPager"></div>
    </section>

    @* ============================ Asset ============================ *@
    <section id="argAssetView" hidden>
        <div class="pm-panel arg-head">
            <div class="arg-head-main">
                <button class="pm-button" id="argBack" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Asset Register</button>
                <div>
                    <div class="arg-head-title" id="argTitle">--</div>
                    <div class="arg-head-meta" id="argMeta"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="arg-head-actions">
                <button class="pm-button primary" id="argSave" type="button" hidden><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pm-message" id="argMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
        <div class="pm-panel arg-issues" id="argIssues" hidden></div>

        @* Asset type selection for a new asset (or an existing one without a type) *@
        <div class="pm-panel" id="argTypeStep" hidden>
            <p class="arg-note">Choose the asset type. The form designed for it (its Active form template) opens next.</p>
            <div class="pm-form-grid">
                <label><span>Main category *</span><select id="argCat"></select></label>
                <label><span>Subcategory *</span><select id="argSub"></select></label>
                <label><span>Asset type *</span><select id="argType"></select></label>
                <div class="full"><button class="pm-button primary" id="argTypeGo" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i> Open form</button></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pm-panel" id="argFormPanel" hidden>
            <div class="pm-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Asset">
                <button role="tab" class="active" data-arg-tab="details" aria-selected="true">Details</button>
                <button role="tab" data-arg-tab="lifecycle" aria-selected="false" id="argLifecycleTab" hidden>Lifecycle</button>
                <button role="tab" data-arg-tab="technology" aria-selected="false" id="argTechTab" hidden>Technology</button>
                <button role="tab" data-arg-tab="custody" aria-selected="false" id="argCustodyTab" hidden>Custody</button>
                <button role="tab" data-arg-tab="coverage" aria-selected="false" id="argCoverageTab" hidden>Coverage</button>
                <button role="tab" data-arg-tab="valuation" aria-selected="false" id="argValTab" hidden>Valuation</button>
                <button role="tab" data-arg-tab="privacy" aria-selected="false" id="argPrivTab" hidden>Privacy</button>
                <button role="tab" data-arg-tab="workflows" aria-selected="false" id="argWorkflowTab" hidden>Workflows</button>
                <button role="tab" data-arg-tab="history" aria-selected="false">History</button>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-arg-panel="details">
                <form id="argForm" autocomplete="off"></form>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-arg-panel="lifecycle" hidden>
                <div class="arg-pending" id="argPending" hidden></div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Moves from the current status</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Move to</th><th>Minimum gate (BRD)</th><th>Needs</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argMoves"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Lifecycle changes</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Requested</th><th>From</th><th>To</th><th>Outcome</th><th>Requested by</th><th>Decided by</th><th>Reason / reference / evidence</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argChanges"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-arg-panel="technology" hidden id="argTechPanel">
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <div class="arg-tech-head">
                        <h3>Installed technology</h3>
                        @if (argCanEdit)
                        {
                            <div class="arg-head-actions">
                                <button class="pm-button" type="button" data-arg-install="FIRMWARE"><i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i> Record firmware installation</button>
                                <button class="pm-button" type="button" data-arg-install="OS"><i class="fa-solid fa-desktop"></i> Record OS installation</button>
                                <button class="pm-button" type="button" data-arg-exc-new="1"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Request exception</button>
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Technology</th><th>Current</th><th>Release status</th><th>Classification</th><th>Recommended target</th><th>Support end / EOL</th><th>Exception</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argTechStatus"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Firmware installations</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Installed</th><th>Release</th><th>Previous</th><th>Source</th><th>Result</th><th>Rollback</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Recorded</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argFwHistory"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Operating-system installations</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Installed</th><th>Release</th><th>Build / patch</th><th>Previous</th><th>Source</th><th>Licence</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Recorded</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argOsHistory"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Technology exceptions</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Applies to</th><th>Reason / controls</th><th>Owner</th><th>Expiry / review</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argTechExceptions"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-arg-panel="custody" hidden>
                <p class="arg-note" id="argCustodyState"></p>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Ownership, custody and location history</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>From</th><th>To</th><th>Asset owner</th><th>Custodian</th><th>Department</th><th>Location</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argAssignments"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Acknowledgements and attestations</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Assignee</th><th>Due</th><th>Status</th><th>Response</th><th>Answered</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argAttestations"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Verification exceptions</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Exception</th><th>Category</th><th>Severity</th><th>Investigator</th><th>Status</th><th>Resolution due</th><th>Outcome</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argVerExceptions"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-arg-panel="coverage" hidden>
                <p class="arg-note" id="argCoverageState"></p>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Coverage by type</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Coverage type</th><th>Status</th><th>Contract</th><th>Effective</th><th>Expiring from</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argCoverageTypes"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Coverage required for the asset type</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Coverage type</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Minimum period</th><th>Licence handling</th><th>On a gap</th><th>Gap</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argCoverageReqs"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Coverage lines (approved contract versions)</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Contract</th><th>Version</th><th>Coverage type</th><th>State</th><th>Status</th><th>Effective</th><th>Entitlement</th><th>Service level</th><th>Vendor reference</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argCoverageLines"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-arg-panel="privacy" hidden id="argPrivPanel">
                <div class="arg-tech-head">
                    <p class="arg-note" id="argPrivState"></p>
                    <div class="arg-pending-actions">
                        <button class="pm-button" type="button" id="argPrivOpen"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i> Open in Asset Privacy</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Requirement gaps</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Gap</th><th>Enforcement</th><th>Exception</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argPrivGaps"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Exceptions</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Status</th><th>Reason / controls</th><th>Owner</th><th>Expiry</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argPrivExceptions"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Reviews</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Review</th><th>Due</th><th>Status</th><th>Outcome</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argPrivReviews"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-arg-panel="valuation" hidden id="argValPanel">
                <div class="arg-tech-head">
                    <p class="arg-note" id="argValState"></p>
                    <div class="arg-pending-actions">
                        @if (argCanEdit)
                        {
                            <button class="pm-button" type="button" id="argValRecalc" hidden><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i> Recalculate</button>
                        }
                        @if (argCanApprove)
                        {
                            <button class="pm-button" type="button" id="argValOverride" hidden><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i> Override method</button>
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Asset Value</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Active configuration now</th><th>Stored</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argValCompare"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <div class="arg-tech-head">
                        <h3>Consistency findings</h3>
                        @if (argCanEdit)
                        {
                            <button class="pm-button" type="button" id="argConsRun"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i> Re-evaluate</button>
                        }
                    </div>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Rule</th><th>Severity</th><th>Status</th><th>Detected</th><th>Acceptance</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argConsBody"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Linked risks</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Risk</th><th>Status</th><th>Inherent / residual</th><th>Asset Value used</th><th>Last assessed</th><th>Review</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argValRisks"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Calculation history</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Source</th><th>Configuration</th><th>C / I / A</th><th>Method</th><th>Score</th><th>Category</th><th>Status</th><th>By</th><th>Reason / message</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argValHistory"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-arg-panel="workflows" hidden id="argWfPanel">
                @if (argCanEdit)
                {
                    <div class="pm-toolbar" id="argWfStartBar">
                        <select id="argWfType" title="Workflow"></select>
                        <button class="pm-button primary" id="argWfStartBtn" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Start workflow</button>
                    </div>
                }
                <div class="arg-pending" id="argWfCase" hidden>
                    <strong id="argWfCaseTitle"></strong>
                    <div class="arg-note" id="argWfCaseInfo"></div>
                    <ol class="arg-wf-steps" id="argWfSteps"></ol>
                    <div id="argWfCurrent" class="pm-form-grid">
                        <p class="arg-note full" id="argWfGuidance"></p>
                        <label class="full" id="argWfChoiceWrap" hidden><span>Containment *</span><select id="argWfChoice"><option value="">Select</option><option value="QUARANTINE">Quarantine</option><option value="CONTROLLED_USE">Controlled use</option></select></label>
                        <label class="full"><span id="argWfNoteLabel">Note</span><textarea id="argWfNote" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
                        <label class="full" id="argWfRefWrap" hidden><span>Reference *</span><input type="text" id="argWfRef" maxlength="400" /></label>
                        <label class="full" id="argWfEvWrap"><span id="argWfEvLabel">Evidence</span><textarea id="argWfEv" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
                        <p class="pm-message full" id="argWfMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
                        <div class="full arg-pending-actions" id="argWfActions"></div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="arg-wf-sub">Case history</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Step</th><th>Outcome</th><th>By</th><th>Note / evidence / reference</th><th>Lifecycle</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argWfHistory"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="arg-section">
                    <h3>Workflow cases of this asset</h3>
                    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Workflow</th><th>Status</th><th>Step</th><th>Started</th><th>Closed</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="argWfCases"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-tab-panel" data-arg-panel="history" hidden>
                <div class="pm-table-wrap">
                    <table>
                        <thead><tr><th>When</th><th>From</th><th>To</th><th>By</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody id="argHistory"></tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

@* ======================= Lifecycle move modal (429) ======================= *@
<div class="pm-modal" id="argMoveModal" hidden>
    <div class="pm-modal-panel">
        <header>
            <h2 id="argMoveTitle">Move asset</h2>
            <button class="pm-modal-close" type="button" data-close-arg="argMoveModal" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </header>
        <form id="argMoveForm" class="pm-form-grid">
            <p class="arg-note full" id="argMoveGate"></p>
            <label class="full"><span id="argMoveReasonLabel">Reason</span><textarea id="argMoveReason" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
            <label class="full" id="argMoveRefWrap"><span id="argMoveRefLabel">Reference *</span><input type="text" id="argMoveRef" maxlength="400" /></label>
            <label class="full" id="argMoveEvWrap"><span>Evidence * <small>(document number, report or link)</small></span><textarea id="argMoveEv" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
            <p class="pm-message full" id="argMoveMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            <footer class="pm-modal-footer full">
                <button type="button" class="pm-button" data-close-arg="argMoveModal">Cancel</button>
                <button type="submit" class="pm-button primary" id="argMoveSave"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i> Move</button>
            </footer>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

@* ======================= Installation modal (430) ======================= *@
<div class="pm-modal" id="argInstallModal" hidden>
    <div class="pm-modal-panel">
        <header>
            <h2 id="argInstallTitle">Record installation</h2>
            <button class="pm-modal-close" type="button" data-close-arg="argInstallModal" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </header>
        <form id="argInstallForm" class="pm-form-grid">
            <label class="full"><span>Release *</span><select id="argInstRelease"></select></label>
            <label><span>Installed date *</span><input type="date" id="argInstDate" /></label>
            <label><span>Source *</span><input type="text" id="argInstSource" maxlength="100" list="argInstSourceList" /></label>
            <datalist id="argInstSourceList"><option value="Manual"></option><option value="Discovery"></option><option value="Import"></option><option value="Vendor service"></option><option value="ERP"></option><option value="API"></option></datalist>
            <label id="argInstResultWrap"><span>Result *</span><select id="argInstResult"><option value="SUCCESSFUL">Successful</option><option value="FAILED">Failed</option></select></label>
            <label id="argInstBuildWrap"><span>Build / patch level</span><input type="text" id="argInstBuild" maxlength="100" /></label>
            <label id="argInstLicenceWrap"><span>Licence</span><input type="text" id="argInstLicence" maxlength="400" /></label>
            <label class="full" id="argInstRollbackWrap"><span>Rollback</span><textarea id="argInstRollback" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
            <label class="full"><span>Evidence <small>(document number, report or link)</small></span><textarea id="argInstEvidence" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
            <p class="arg-note full">A successful installation becomes the asset's current version and needs an approved compatibility record for its model or an active technology exception.</p>
            <p class="pm-message full" id="argInstMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            <footer class="pm-modal-footer full">
                <button type="button" class="pm-button" data-close-arg="argInstallModal">Cancel</button>
